sections.wikitext:
Many artists have covered "You Light Up My Life" since 1977.
*[[Perry Como]] performed it on Bob Hope's TV special in 1977 (then recorded for CD in 2000).{{fact|date=January 2026}}
*[[Johnny Mathis]] recorded the song and named his [[You Light Up My Life (Johnny Mathis album)|1978 album]] after the song.{{fact|date=January 2026}}
*[[Engelbert Humperdinck (singer)|Engelbert Humperdinck]] also recorded "You Light Up My Life" in 1978, including it on his album ''"Last of the Romantics"''.{{fact|date=January 2026}} 
*[[Valeria Lynch]] recorded the song covered "Tú me haces feliz" for her 1979 album ''Yo soy tu canción...''.{{fact|date=January 2026}}
*Japanese singer [[Yuki Saito (actress)|Yuki Saito]] recorded it (in English) for her 1994 album ''Moi.''{{fact|date=January 2026}}
*[[Whitney Houston]] recorded the song for her 2002 album ''[[Just Whitney]]...''.{{fact|date=January 2026}} 
*The Irish] pop band [[Westlife]] recorded a cover of the song on their ''[[The Love Album (Westlife album)|The Love Album]]'' album in 2006.{{fact|date=January 2026}}
*A French rendering entitled "''Tu remplis ma vie''" was recorded by [[Anne Renée]] in 1977.{{fact|date=January 2026}}
*[[America's Got Talent (season 1)|''America's Got Talent'' season 1]] winner [[Bianca Ryan]] covered the song for her 2006 debut album.{{fact|date=January 2026}}
*[[Patti Smith]] performed the song on the ABC television program ''[[Kids Are People Too]]'', accompanied by Brooks on piano.<ref>{{cite web|title=Video of the Day: Patti Smith Sings "You Light Up My Life" to Kids|url=http://flavorwire.com/97262/video-of-the-day-patti-smith-sings-you-light-up-my-life-to-kids/|access-date=24 February 2014|archive-date=27 February 2014|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20140227082011/http://flavorwire.com/97262/video-of-the-day-patti-smith-sings-you-light-up-my-life-to-kids/|url-status=dead}}</ref>
*Mexican pop singer, Yuri recorded the song cover “Tú iluminas mi vida” for her first album released in 1978.{{fact|date=January 2026}}
*Filipina singer, [[Angeline Quinto]] recorded the song for her second album ''Fall in Love Again'' released in 2012.{{fact|date=January 2026}}
* The song has also been recorded by [[Aretha Franklin]], [[Loleatta Holloway]], [[Jean Carne|Jean Carn]], [[Kenny Rogers]], [[Angeline Quinto]], [[José Carreras]], [[Robert Goulet]], [[Carole King]], and [[Samantha Cole]].<ref>{{cite web|url=https://secondhandsongs.com/performance/131846 |title=Cover versions of You Light Up My Life by Debby Boone |website=SecondHandSongs.com |access-date=2016-10-13}}</ref>

